    "claim": "StartActionByGet and StartActionByGetAndWait never call validateJustificationRequired, so actions that require a justification run with an empty justification. Impact is a bypass of the audit control, not privilege escalation, because the exec ACL still applies.",
    "source": "POST /api/olivetin.api.v1.OliveTinApiService/StartActionByGet (or StartActionByGetAndWait) with an ActionId. Any user with exec permission, guests included, can send it.",
    "sink": "executor.ExecRequest runs the action and records entry.Justification via ResolveJustification (service/internal/executor/justification.go:34-45).",
